            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"what-is-x\">What is x?</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Marimo will not allow you to assign values to 'x' in 2 different cells. This breaks the reactivity. When this notebook was produced by Marimo's Jupyter converter tool, it renamed x to x_1 for the second instance of x.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Notice the error when x is initialized in 2 different cells. No problem is x is assigned twice in the same cell.</span></span>"
